`Magma.rev2903aBad` holds the `13` clone members the subclones miss -- exactly the ones
that do generate `◇`. A target refuted by all of them is therefore not term-structural
from `2903`, over finite magmas and hence over all of them.

This file is generated by `revemit.py`.
